hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1567","Yahya bin Hakim told us, Abu Qutaibah told us, and Yahya bin Hammad told us, on the authority of Harun bin Muslim, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Muawiyah bin Qurra, on the authority of his father Qurra, said: “We were forbidden from praying between the pillars, and were expelled from them.”"
